Liquid Glass Android Port

This distribution is a pure Android derivative of the following Apache-2.0
licensed projects by Kyant:

1. AndroidLiquidGlass
   Upstream: https://github.com/Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass
   Baseline commit: b18eb0ff12c616546a68c72e7d0097f1ab286c87
   Copyright 2025 Kyant

2. Shapes
   Upstream: https://github.com/Kyant0/Shapes
   Baseline commit: acf86616d1f3e911e95e2e624cd86438c1426a17
   Copyright 2026 Kyant

Changes in this derivative:
- Flattened commonMain and Android actual source sets into a pure Android library.
- Changed Kotlin packages from com.kyant.backdrop and com.kyant.shapes to
  com.linrjk.liquid and com.linrjk.liquid.shapes.
- Embedded Shapes into the same AAR.
- Ported the catalog to a separate Android sample application.

The algorithms and AGSL shader implementations are retained from the upstream
baseline except for package/import changes and the expect/actual flattening
required by the Android-only project structure.

The sample Ripple implementation retains its original Android Open Source
Project copyright and Apache-2.0 notice in the source file.

The upstream project names are used only to describe origin. This derivative is
not endorsed by Kyant.
